// A reactive `for` that sends whole numbers to a field it also reads
// goes through the log in the order of the rows, what it sends combined
// when it ends: the same as a scan over every entity gives (which runs
// for the same ones), and with threads.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/reactive_deferred.ent 2>/dev/null > %t.out
// RUN: sed -e 's/  for me, n: N with Go on added Go {/  for me, n: N with Go without Sent {\n    me.add(Sent)/' \
// RUN:     -e 's/^tag Go$/tag Go\ntag Sent/' \
// RUN:     %S/Inputs/reactive_deferred.ent > %t.scan.ent
// RUN: %ent run %t.scan.ent 2>/dev/null | cmp - %t.out
// RUN: %ent run --parallel %S/Inputs/reactive_deferred.ent 2>/dev/null | cmp - %t.out
